WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.500
A triangle's three angles always add to one hundred and eighty degrees.

2
00:00:05.652 --> 00:00:09.652
In this triangle, the three angles add to one hundred and eighty.

3
00:00:10.481 --> 00:00:14.256
Make one angle big, and the others shrink. Still one eighty.

4
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.435
Even a very flat triangle: still one eighty.

5
00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:26.601
Why? Tear off the corners, and they make a straight line.
